  "goodToKnow": "Das Trikot is a sports jersey or shirt: das Nationaltrikot, das Auswärtstrikot (away kit). The word is French, so the t is silent: tri-KOH. Players swap Trikots after big matches. In cycling, das Gelbe Trikot is the Tour de France leader's yellow jersey. Germany's four World Cup stars sit above the badge on the national team's Trikot. Plural: die Trikots."
